---
// Small teaser for the CLI on the homepage. Links to the full /cli page.
---

<section class="cli-teaser" id="cli">
  <div class="container inner">
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="tag">Command line</p>
      <h2>Your stats,<br /><em>in the terminal.</em></h2>
      <p>
        Prefer the shell? The yips CLI pulls your rounds, strokes gained, and
        club numbers straight to your terminal. Pipe them into a spreadsheet, a
        script, or an AI.
      </p>
      <a href="/cli" class="btn-cli">Explore the CLI &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="term" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="term-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <pre><code><span class="p">$</span> yips rounds        <span class="c"># list your rounds</span>
<span class="p">$</span> yips stats         <span class="c"># stats across all rounds</span>
<span class="p">$</span> yips shots         <span class="c"># per-shot strokes gained</span>
<span class="p">$</span> yips clubs --json  <span class="c"># pipe it anywhere</span></code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cli-teaser {
    padding: 72px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 38px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  h2 em { color: var(--green); font-style: normal; }

  .copy p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .btn-cli {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--bg);
    background: var(--green);
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .btn-cli:hover { opacity: 0.88; }

  /* Terminal panel */
  .term {
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .term-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
  }

  .term-bar span {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #333;
  }

  .term pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: 'Courier New', 'Menlo', 'Monaco', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .term .p { color: var(--green); }
  .term .c { color: #64748b; }
</style>
